OL,3,CFive houses destroyed after fire in
OL,4,CNewbridge
OL,6,FFive houses have been destroyed after
OL,7,Fa fire near Newbridge in Caerphilly
OL,8,FCounty.
OL,10,FFire crews were called to a fire on
OL,11,FHazelwood Road on Wednesday afternoon
OL,12,F(12 August).
OL,14,FIn a statement, South Wales Fire and
OL,15,FRescue Service said it "is continuing
OL,16,Fto deal with a domestic property fire
OL,17,Fon Hazelwood Road, Pantside,
OL,18,FNewbridge."
