OL,3,CFive houses destroyed after fire in
OL,4,CNewbridge
OL,6,F"The incident involves five terraced
OL,7,Fbungalows. There have been no reported
OL,8,Fcasualties.
OL,10,F"Members of the public are urged to
OL,11,Fstay away from the area to allow
OL,12,Femergency services to operate safely
OL,13,Fand to keep windows and doors closed
OL,14,Fdue to smoke in the area."
OL,16,FPosting on social media, Newbridge RFC
OL,17,Fsaid: "We are absolutely heartbroken
OL,18,Fto have seen the horrendous fire
OL,19,Fearlier this evening at Pantside and
OL,20,Fthe devastation caused in such a short
OL,21,Fspace of time.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
